.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd September 25, 2026
.Dt RC.CONF 5
.Os OxideBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm rc.conf
.Nd system configuration for rc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Pa /etc/rc.conf
holds the settings that
.Xr rc 8
and the
.Pa rc.d
scripts use: which services start, and with what options.
Every setting and its default is listed in
.Pa /etc/defaults/rc.conf ,
which is read first and should not be edited;
.Pa /etc/rc.conf ,
then
.Pa /etc/rc.conf.local
if it exists, override it.
Settings for one service may also be put in
.Pa /etc/rc.conf.d/ Ns Ar service .
.Pp
Each line is an assignment,
.Ar name Ns = Ns Ar value ,
or a comment.
The values are shell words: quoted, and may refer to other settings with
.Li ${ Ns Ar name Ns } .
The files are read, not run: any other line is reported with its file and
line number, and ignored.
.Pp
A service
.Ar foo
starts only if
.Va foo_enable
is
.Dq YES .
The values of
.Va *_enable
and
.Va *_restart
must be
.Dq YES ,
.Dq NO ,
.Dq TRUE ,
.Dq FALSE ,
.Dq ON ,
.Dq OFF ,
.Dq 1
or
.Dq 0 ,
in any case; any other value is reported and counts as
.Dq NO .
.Va foo_flags
adds options to the service's command, and
.Va foo_program
replaces the command.
.Pp
The settings:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Va rc_conf_files
The files read after
.Pa /etc/defaults/rc.conf .
Default:
.Dq Pa /etc/rc.conf /etc/rc.conf.local .
.It Va rc_info
Print informational messages from the scripts.
.It Va rc_debug
Print debugging messages from the scripts.
.It Va rc_startmsgs
Print
.Dq Starting Ar foo .
messages during the boot.
.It Va rcshutdown_timeout
Seconds
.Pa /etc/rc.shutdown
may take before
.Xr init 8
stops it.
Default 90.
.It Va hostname
The host's name.
If empty, the kernel's default,
.Dq oxidebsd ,
is kept.
.It Va tmpmfs
Mount a memory file system on
.Pa /tmp :
.Dq YES ,
.Dq NO ,
or
.Dq AUTO
(the default), which mounts one only if
.Pa /tmp
is not writable.
.It Va tmpmfs_flags
Extra
.Xr mount 8
options for it.
.It Va cleanvar_enable
Remove the files in
.Pa /var/run
at boot.
.It Va network_interfaces
The interfaces
.Pa /etc/rc.d/netif
configures, or
.Dq AUTO
(the default) for all of them.
.It Va ifconfig_ Ns Ar interface
How to configure
.Ar interface :
.Xr ifconfig 8
arguments, such as
.Dq inet 10.0.2.15/24 ,
or
.Dq DHCP
to run
.Xr dhclient 8
on it.
Default for
.Li lo0 :
.Dq inet 127.0.0.1/8 .
.It Va dhclient_flags , Va dhclient_flags_ Ns Ar interface
Flags to
.Xr dhclient 8 ,
for every interface or for one.
.It Va background_dhclient , Va background_dhclient_ Ns Ar interface
.Dq YES :
don't wait for a lease at boot.
Default
.Dq NO .
.It Va defaultrouter
The default route's gateway, set by
.Pa /etc/rc.d/routing ,
or
.Dq NO
(the default).
It replaces a default route
.Xr dhclient 8
set.
.It Va static_routes
Names of other routes, each
.Va route_ Ns Ar name
holding
.Xr route 8
.Cm add
arguments.
Only default routes can be set so far.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/defaults/rc.conf -compact
.It Pa /etc/rc.conf
.It Pa /etc/rc.conf.local
.It Pa /etc/rc.conf.d/
.It Pa /etc/defaults/rc.conf
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
hostname="shed.example.org"
ifconfig_rl0="DHCP"
cron_enable="YES"
cron_flags="-J 15"
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr dhclient 8 ,
.Xr ifconfig 8 ,
.Xr rc 8 ,
.Xr rc.subr 8 ,
.Xr route 8
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
file appeared in
.Fx 2.2.2 .
